{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":117024,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793466300226,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2023,"episodeCount":24,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/alOpgvMX6LwfZOnoXbsNr7SyDZA.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"2660256","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sariphi arrives in the kingdom of beasts as the 99th human sacrifice to its monstrous king. But this surprisingly upbeat girl isn't what anyone expected. What will come of her brief days with the king before he's scheduled to devour her?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-04-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aPPwUAriS4bIm9mrnJIX034YMeA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aPPwUAriS4bIm9mrnJIX034YMeA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/117024/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"4376239","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Leonhart announces Sariphi as his queen-to-be, but the beast aristocracy is less than enthusiastic. Can their budding relationship survive the backlash, and can Sariphi make a place for herself in the realm of beasts?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-04-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6ZXUZEf30ysF9tgZy7pnNQIDW7V.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6ZXUZEf30ysF9tgZy7pnNQIDW7V.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/117024/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"4376240","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sariphi begs Leonhart for a day out on the town. They slip out of the palace incognito to meet the common people of the beast realm, but unexpected dangers lie in wait.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-05-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cqpeIJTV4sglkCYbkXwkT7eohgP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cqpeIJTV4sglkCYbkXwkT7eohgP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/117024/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"4376241","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Chancellor Anubis summons four beast princesses to court Leonhart, hoping to supplant Sariphi in the king's affections. Does Sariphi have the wit and resolve to navigate their schemes?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-05-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gGSbAImNWoHQz4SXHX08TNjEHEv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gGSbAImNWoHQz4SXHX08TNjEHEv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/117024/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"4376242","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Anubis and the senate agree to accept Sariphi as queen—but only if she passes their trials first. Sariphi agrees, but her first task—summoning a Holy Beast—could prove fatal to a human without magical power.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-05-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9xINGopgieLtkqLFZLxS1Cf3jlQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9xINGopgieLtkqLFZLxS1Cf3jlQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/117024/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"4376243","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"o